{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A modern interpretation of the old &quot;steady hand&quot;/wire buzzer game from the 60's in VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your hand steady whilst moving a ring along a wire! Dodge obstacles, be as quick as you can, and don't touch the wire too much or you'll explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FUR\u014c is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and has many features planned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features available in <strong>Early Access</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loads of levels</strong>, in a variety of bizarre environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock stars which can be spent on, well, more levels!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned feature additions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer (Online)</strong>: Compete with other players to complete levels in the quickest time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Editor</strong>: Create levels and share them with others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wildcards</strong>: Think of these like a variety of &quot;weapon mods&quot;. Slow down time to traverse fast moving &quot;platforms&quot; easier, teleport from one part of the level to another, regenerate health, and more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476210?t=1745236361","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745236361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476210/2fcf40005466246e8deb0ff80eec0ba495cfb72f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745236361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476210/2fcf40005466246e8deb0ff80eec0ba495cfb72f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745236361","categories":[{"de